teWithTimeout with 100ms on infinite loop ('while(true){}') -> success is false\n   - result has duration >= 0 and memoryUsed >= 0\n\n4. describe('Reviews') with tests:\n   - addReview returns Review with numeric id and string createdAt, flagged=false\n   - getReviews returns reviews for plugin\n   - getAverageRating excludes flagged (flag one of two reviews, check average changes)\n   - getAverageRating returns 0 when no reviews\n   - getFlaggedReviews returns only flagged\n   - removeReview returns true and review is gone\n   - removeReview returns false for nonexistent id 999\n   - getReviewsByUser filters by userId\n   - getReviewCount includes flagged reviews in count\n\n5. describe('Deps') with tests:\n   Setup helper: function makeChain() { const r = createRegistry(); r.register(makeManifest('A','1.0.0',{B:'^1.0.0'})); r.register(makeManifest('B','1.0.0',{C:'^1.0.0'})); r.register(makeManifest('C','1.0.0')); return r; }\n   - buildTree returns tree with A->B->C nesting\n   - detectCycles returns null for acyclic (A->B->C)\n   - detectCycles finds cycle: register D->{E} and E->{D}, expect non-null result\n   - topologicalSort: C comes before B, B comes before A\n   - flattenDependencies for A: includes B and C, not A itself\n   - hasCircularDependency false for A, true for cycle D\n\n6. describe('Marketplace Integration') with tests:\n   - createMarketplace() has all 5 services defined\n   - installPlugin with no deps: success, resolvedDependencies empty, plugin registered\n   - installPlugin throws on missing name (pass name: '')\n   - installPlugin throws on missing entryPoint (pass entryPoint: '')\n   - installPlugin resolves available deps: pre-register dep-a@1.2.0, install plugin with dep {dep-a:^1.0.0}, expect resolvedDependencies has dep-a@1.2.0\n   - installPlugin throws on circular: pre-register dep-cycle with dep on myplugin, install myplugin with dep on dep-cycle\n\nWrite the complete working TypeScript test file to /workspace/tests/marketplace.test.ts`, { label: 'tests' })\n\nphase('Verify')\nconst verifyResult = await agent(`Verify the plugin marketplace project at /workspace by running:\n1. npm run build\n2. npm run lint\n3. npm test\n\nUse the Bash tool. Run each command with 'cd /workspace && <command> 2>&1'. \nReport the COMPLETE output of each command including any errors. Do NOT fix anything.`, { label: 'verify' })\n\nreturn { verifyResult }\n","uuid":"51444b8b-bace-4265-adbe-b7781a93ca01","session_id":"51968f16-75e3-45ce-a94d-4e3e2204f8a9"}
